feedback pattern 154A-1627 The name reader $1513 runs in the other register set (EXX), so C and DE swap meaning across calls; cards could say which set a register fact is in
feedback listing 0505-0550 Opened the dispatcher to learn the flags fn 6 enters with (A = 0, Z, AF' = 2n) for the JP NZ at $17F7
